NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses across East Wales — Flintshire, Denbighshire, and the surrounding area. Every logo is designed by hand — no AI, no templates.

## What's included

- 5 initial logo concepts
- Revisions until you're completely happy
- Brand colour palette and typography choices
- Brand guidelines document
- All file formats: PNG, SVG, PDF, JPEG

We work with businesses across Mold, Flint, Buckley, Holywell, Ruthin, Denbigh, and the wider East Wales area.

We also offer [web design for East Wales businesses](/web-design-east-wales/), [local SEO in East Wales](/seo-east-wales/), and [ecommerce web design for East Wales businesses](/ecommerce-web-design-east-wales/).

See all our [web design East Wales services](/web-design-east-wales/).
